<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:11.590
TOTTORI PREFECTURAL OFFICE

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.230
Governor.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.650
Here's the file from the other day
on preventing Tottori's population loss.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:19.300
GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:18.930
We polled young individuals on
why they moved to the city.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:23.410
Thanks for polling the peop-oll!

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:31.170
Tottori Prefecture has
the lowest population in Japan.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:35.320
<i>"Why did you move to the city?"</i>

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:35.420
We have to prevent
further population loss.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.030
<i>"I just felt like it."</i>

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:46.220
Tottori is a wonderful prefecture!
How can we get people to understand?!

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.650
My Kuromi Yaki vase!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.730
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.450
We've finally reached Sakaiminato.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.200
Why did I have to come?

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:03.450
We want to actually enjoy
a vacation this year.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:06.910
Mana should be arriving soon too.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.810
YONAGO AIRPORT TERMINAL

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.460
I'm here again this summer!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.410
Huh?

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.130
What is this?

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.440
Um, excuse me.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.010
What's this line for?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.510
It's for immigration.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.390
Huh?

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:23.090
Tottori seceded from Japan

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.830
THE GREAT TOTTORI EMPIRE IMMIGRATION

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.930
and became the Great Tottori Empire.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.310
Huh?

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:30.310
What?!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.370
CHAPTER 65

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:36.320
NATION FOUNDING?!
MABYO'S GREAT TOTTORI EMPIRE

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.820
Tottori exercise No.1!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.820
Crab pose!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.450
Crab!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.320
Next! Pear pose!

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:50.330
Everyone, the Great Tottori Empire
is a country created by god.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:55.080
My, oh my. Mana-chan,
it's good you came again this year.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.050
Aunt Rie! What's going on?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.260
My, oh my.
It's Prefectural Governor Nozawa's will.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.280
TOTTORI PREFECTURAL GOVERNOR
MASASHI NOZAWA

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.350
It's to liven up Tottori Prefecture.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:08.560
But to secede? That's nuts.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.450
TO A TOTALLY TOTTORI FUTURE!!

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:12.770
My, oh my. It's not nuts at all.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.810
Huh?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:18.320
Tottori is the greatest land in Japan,
no, the universe!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.070
The people and weather
and air are beautiful!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.320
Look!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:24.570
The trees! And the birds!

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:28.260
They're all sparkling with
love for Tottori!

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.890
Hooray for the Great Tottori Empire!

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.500
A-Aunt Rie?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.010
What? Am I wrong?

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:39.260
N-No!

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.340
Hey, where's Uncle Shoji?

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:46.220
He went to see the governor's
press conference. You'll see him tonight.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.090
Mana.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.220
Cat-san, you made it!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.250
Oh, Kitaro-san. It's been a while.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.850
It's been a while.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:58.070
Is it me, or has the town changed?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.110
Is there a festival or something?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.740
Wh-What?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:09.160
You! Eating such gaudy things is illegal
in the Great Tottori Empire!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.910
If you want to eat something, eat these!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:16.170
Pear ice cream, pear caramels,
pear chocolate...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:20.920
They all use delicious pears harvested
in the Great Tottori Empire!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.510
It's all pear stuff.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.130
Wait. Illegal?

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:30.260
If you go to the Nijisseiki Pear Museum,
you can eat and compare pears!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.890
I wasn't asking about that.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:37.270
Now, now, let's not stand and talk.
How about some tea?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.820
Sure. Oh, how about at Snowbucks?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.900
There's one in Tottori, isn't there?

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:50.370
Snowbucks is a trendy spot of holiness!
One cannot just waltz in there!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.680
First fill out this application form!

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:58.420
On the other hand, no application
is needed for entry to Sunayama Coffee.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.670
Sunayama...? Entry?

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.050
Pear Trio-sama is passing through!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.030
What's going on?

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:11.470
It's Tottori's top idol, Pear Trio-sama.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:16.100
To not humble oneself in their presence
is a crime of disrespect.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.540
Now hurry.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:23.190
But why is this happening?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.860
Delicious.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:31.320
Governor, what is the Great Tottori
Empire's upcoming policy direction?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.090
With the Great Tottori Empire...

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.870
the world is totally ours! Just kidding.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:46.720
Why such a bold decision like
seceding from Japan?

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.470
Isn't it foolhardy?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.860
We're taking Tottori into a new age...

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.470
Let's seize the subtle spotlight
and totally Tottorize it!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.560
Go!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:02.290
<i>Tottori, Tottori, Tottori...</i>

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:08.110
Well said, Governor!
What a sense of humor!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:12.090
With Tottori's appeal,
seceding could be a winning move!

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.560
Something is indeed wrong.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.910
That explains it.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.170
Tottori became an independent nation.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.250
That's why the weird laws are in place.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.170
Weird laws?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.470
What Governor Nozawa does can't be wrong.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.490
Even during disasters,

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:34.600
he always stood on the front lines,
leading us.

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.810
With him and the Great Tottori Empire,

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.310
the world is totally ours!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:42.020
But it doesn't make sense.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:45.060
You already have
the lowest population in Japan.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.420
Doing this will only make things...

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.630
You...

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.320
You can't say that!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.460
An insult.

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:02.640
You're under arrest...
for insulting Tottori!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.190
-TOTTORI LOVE
-PEARS

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.260
Seriously? That's all it takes...

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:11.030
to be sent to a rehabilitation center?

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.180
Tottori!

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:17.140
You three. How dare you insult Tottori.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.140
We didn't mean to...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.410
Silence!

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:24.270
I'll make it so
you never insult Tottori again.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.440
<i>Tottori</i>

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.530
First, write "Tottori Love" 10,000 times!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:37.970
This will carve love for the Great
Tottori Empire into your subconscious!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.370
My hands are tired!

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.540
<i>Tottori</i>

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:45.130
Next, crying out love
in the center of the Tottori Sand Dunes!

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.830
I'll show you!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.280
Tottori! I love you!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.390
You! Try it!

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.220
Huh?

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.390
Tottori. I love you.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.430
Like you mean it!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.680
<i>Tottori</i>

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.390
And last is this!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.980
If you can speak love for Tottori
while having you nose pinched by crabs,

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.320
you're a member of
the Great Tottori Empire!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.090
Now do it!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.740
You...

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.410
That's enough!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.410
I-It's okay!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.120
You can choose between
a snow crab or Matsuba crab!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.540
That's not the issue!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.300
With the Great Tottori Empire,
the world is totally ours!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.630
The world is totally ours!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.860
Wait a minute!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.760
It's true that Tottori is wonderful.
But this is wrong!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:45.580
The governor I know
wouldn't make such a policy!

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.120
Oh?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.860
And who are you?

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.770
Huh?!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.820
Pear!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.620
Crab!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.160
SPECIAL ASSASSINATION FORCE
PEAR TARO AND CRAB JIRO

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:00.490
Take him!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.660
-Pear!
-Crab!

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:06.520
Rie!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:12.630
My, oh my. What's wrong?
You're out of breath.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.250
Listen to me carefully!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:17.360
The governor is an imposter!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:23.430
I don't know what he's after,
but we can't leave Tottori to him!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.940
Traitor.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:25.950
Huh?

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.270
You traitor!

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.110
And you call yourself a member of
the Great Tottori Empire?!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:33.570
How dare you insult the governor!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:34.480
W-Wait...

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:35.740
Traitor!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.290
How dare you!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.260
Kinopi! You've got to...

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:44.120
Hello, police? I've got a traitor here.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.480
-Pear!
-Crab!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.460
I had enough of that.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:57.430
Mana!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:58.800
Uncle Shoji?

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.720
Kitaro-san and Catchick-san.
What are you doing here?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.930
I mean, it's an emergency!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.310
We have to stop that governor!

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.350
He's not the real governor!
He's an imposter!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.610
What?!

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:14.320
What do you mean?

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:18.930
I'm an old friend of Governor Nozawa
and we've often fought.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.530
But I'm...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.220
GOVERNOR NOZAWA SECRET JOKE COLLECTION
BY SHOJI INUYAMA

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.330
a huge fan of his jokes!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.320
What's that?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.580
I've written down
every joke he's ever told.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:31.170
I've been writing them for 12 years,
ever since his election.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.880
That's how I can tell.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.340
The current governor...

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:37.730
-SLOPPY
-TOO WORDY!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.840
The level of his jokes has
obviously dropped!

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:42.700
-TOTTORI SECEDING FROM JAPAN?!
-PROTECT TOTTORI SPECIALITIES

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:42.700
And this crazy policy
he'd never have thought of before...

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.890
There's only one conclusion.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.350
The current governor...

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.140
is an imposter!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.280
That's your proof?

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.870
Th-That's not all!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.660
He used some hypnosis to brainwash
the reporters at the conference!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.980
Everyone in Tottori's been brainwashed!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.150
And who's going to believe that?

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:28.140
You should all just worship
the Great Tottori Empire.

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.390
Go!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.700
Mana!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:38.050
<i>Tottori, Tottori, Tottori...</i>

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.660
Tottori is really wonderful!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:47.280
You've got to buy lots of
Kitaro merchandise at Mizuki Road!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:51.210
With the Great Tottori Empire,
the world is totally ours!

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:54.040
-Totally ours! Totally ours!
-They're gone.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.790
Kitaro!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.790
Cat-san!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:00.170
Daddy Eyeball-san!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:03.590
Totally ours!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.590
TOTTORI SAND DUNES

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:12.100
TOTTORI'S NIJISSEIKI PEARS

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:10.990
-<i>"No, no."</i>
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.000
<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:18.080
I can't believe that happened to
Kitaro and Cat-san.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.280
Just what is the governor?

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.920
That's what we're going to find out.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:28.240
If we can get proof he's an imposter,
everyone will come around.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.250
It's the perfect plan.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:36.840
Using my <i>yokai</i> power and combined Tottori
specialties of Matsuba crab, snow crab,

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:41.920
Nijisseiki pears, and Ojo mackerel
essence, I have created the final weapon.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.860
The Tottori Trance!

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:50.100
If I scatter this, Japan,
no, the world will fall under my spell.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.140
Everyone will be worshipers of
the Great Tottori Empire!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.360
MABYO

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.070
I had my suspicions, but...

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:10.930
Who's there?!

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.830
You again!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:21.590
You showed yourself!
We'll tell everyone what you really are!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:25.170
No one will believe you!

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.270
Get back here! This is for my ideals!

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:32.620
Beep!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.210
Hey, Maki, are you all right?!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.360
Shunsuke...

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.490
Sunabababa...!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.570
Mana, upstairs!

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.220
Rakkyo!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.620
Take that!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.560
Rakkyo!

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:52.850
Stop!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.620
You slippery little...

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:03.590
There's nowhere left to run.
Now become obedient imperial citizens!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:10.160
<i>Tottori, Tottori, Tottori...</i>

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.010
Uncle Shoji!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.250
<i>Tottori, Tottori, Tottori...</i>

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.900
Why won't my brainwashing work?!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:31.530
Kitaro! Cat-san!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.890
You're back to...

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.040
All who would defy
the Great Tottori Empire...

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.250
Must die.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.580
So there!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.790
What?!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.010
The Great Tottori Empire
is heaven on Earth.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:50.590
Any who would soil its radiance,
no matter who, must be eliminated.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.100
It's time to become sand.

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.850
Seriously?!

00:15:56.700 --> 00:16:00.810
They've been brainwashed well.
How obedient.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:06.070
Why are you doing this?!
Why brainwash everyone?!

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.200
My motive...

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.690
is my love for Tottori.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.860
What?!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:16.990
I was born and raised here.
No one loves Tottori more than me.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:21.710
But now, Tottori faces
a decline in population.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:21.640
<i>"I just felt like it."</i>

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:26.340
Why doesn't anyone think of
such a wonderful place?!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.840
I can't allow Tottori to be neglected.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.450
So I disguised myself as the governor...

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.930
and brainwashed the humans.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.160
I made them think
Tottori is the best place in the world.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:46.110
And if I scatter this,
everyone in the world will be brainwashed.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:52.860
Tottori will be a metropolis rivaling
Tokyo or even New York or Paris!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.870
Get real.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:00.620
Your Tottori Love is wrong!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:05.380
Tottori's appeal
doesn't require brainwashing to see!

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:08.090
The food is good...
There's so much nature...

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.880
But most appealing of all...

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:17.090
is the warm hearts of...
the people who live here!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:22.640
How can you control them through
brainwashing and call it Tottori Love?!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:27.440
If you truly loved Tottori,
you couldn't do that!

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.770
Uncle Shoji...

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:32.900
I see.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:36.410
I wondered why my brainwashing
didn't work on you.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.660
For someone who already
loves Tottori more than all else,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.910
it was meaningless.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:45.940
But your love is not like mine!

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:51.750
I'm going to use this to
make the world Tottori's!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:57.280
You can watch there with your fingers,
no, with crab claws in your mouths!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.950
Get back here!

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.230
Give me that!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.390
Let go!

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.450
Uncle Shoji, are you all right?!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:44.810
Tottori Power is growing exponentially
inside him?!

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:49.190
Could it be, he absorbed
the power of the Tottori Trance,

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.670
and is turning it into
his own Tottori Power?!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.850
Oh no you don't!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:10.850
I can see them... Your weak spots!

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.460
Daisen!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.210
Tottori Sand Dunes!

00:19:16.490 --> 00:19:17.970
Uradome Beach!

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.470
Sakaiminato!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.220
Yumeminato Tower!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.810
Nijisseiki Pears!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.390
Daiei Watermelons!

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.930
Kurayoshi Prince Melons!

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:33.750
Crab Guns!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:43.040
Uncle Shoji, what was that?!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.080
I don't... know.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:49.710
Was I...?!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:53.090
You were brainwashed by
the <i>yokai</i> disguised as the governor!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.230
Huh?

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.820
You've got some nerve!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.290
Kitaro-san, Catchick-san.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.460
Could you... forgive him?

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:19.340
His methods were wrong,
but he's still a proud citizen of Tottori.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:26.560
I lose to your Tottori Love.

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:31.940
TOTTORI PREFECTURAL OFFICE

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.940
Tottori Love isn't a competition!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:36.260
<i>Soon after, the real governor was found.</i>

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.650
<i>And the Great Tottori Empire
became Tottori Prefecture again.</i>

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:46.220
<i>Nobody really remembers what happened
under the brainwash of the fake governor.</i>

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.180
<i>But...</i>

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:52.230
I didn't notice before,
but my house is full of pear sweets.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.520
Mine too.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.570
I tried some and they're really good.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:21:01.760
It makes you glad to be born in Tottori.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:07.830
Minced sardine soup is the best!

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:12.710
Are you sure leaving that Mabyo alone
is a good idea?

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.370
I hope he doesn't do something again.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:20.380
You know, thanks to him,
Tottori feels livelier.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.280
I guess all's well that ends well.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.280
BROUGHT TO YOU BY TOTTORI PREFECTURE

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.490
PRESS CONFERENCE

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.490
Oh, it's starting.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:31.020
<i>Why did you revert the Great Tottori
Empire to Tottori Prefecture?</i>

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:34.690
<i>Are the rumors of a fake governor true?</i>

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.650
<i>I'll answer all your questions in turn.</i>

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:42.090
<i>But first, I'd like to just say this.</i>

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:45.990
<i>Sorry to in-crab-venience you!</i>

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:50.540
Ooh! The governor's new joke!
The governor's jokes are so sharp!

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.240
Oh... are they?

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:54.540
That's pretty good indeed.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.250
Dad...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.900
<i>Wel-crab to Tottori!</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:04.550
<i>A mysterious bridge
across Sakaiminato's beach.</i>

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:06.840
<i>Dad, Mana is...?!</i>

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:09.680
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:12.510
<i>"The Shinigami
and Sakaiminato's Hidden Village"</i>

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:15.180
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
